<!DOCTYPE html>
<html data-bs-theme="dark">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

    <title>Metastore Admin - Compaction</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/bootstrap-5.3.3.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/bootstrap-icons-1.8.1.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/pyroscope-styles.css">
    <script src="/static/bootstrap-5.3.3.bundle.min.js"></script>

    <style>
        .card-detail-row {
            display: flex;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        .card-detail-label {
            flex: 0 0 20%;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-align: right;
            padding-right: 1rem;
        }
        .card-detail-value {
            flex: 0 0 80%;
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .card-detail-row {
                flex-direction: column;
            }
            .card-detail-label {
                text-align: left;
                padding-right: 0;
                margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
            }
        }
        .card {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
    <div class="container mt-5">
        <div class="header row border-bottom py-3 flex-column-reverse flex-sm-row">
            <div class="col-12 col-sm-9 text-center text-sm-start">
                <h1>Metastore: Grafana Pyroscope</h1>
            </div>
            <div class="col-12 col-sm-3 text-center text-sm-end mb-3 mb-sm-0">
                <a href="/">
                    <img alt="Pyroscope logo" class="pyroscope-brand" src="/static/pyroscope-logo.png">
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row my-3">
            <h2>Compaction</h2>
            <p class="text-body-secondary">
                Blocks flushed by the segment writers are queued for compaction per tenant, shard, and
                compaction level. Compaction jobs are created from these queues on demand, as compaction
                workers report spare capacity, and are assigned to workers, prioritizing lower levels.
                Job ownership is granted for a limited time (a lease) and is protected with fencing tokens.
            </p>
            <details class="text-body-secondary mb-3">
                <summary>How to read this page</summary>
                <ul class="mt-2">
                    <li>
                        <strong>Unassigned</strong> jobs wait in the scheduler queue for a worker.
                        <strong>In progress</strong> jobs are owned by a worker that renews its lease with
                        every status update (typically every few seconds).
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        If a lease expires (<strong>lease expired</strong>), the worker is assumed to have
                        abandoned the job: the job is reassigned to the next worker that asks for one, and
                        its reassignment (failure) counter is incremented. Workers do not report failures
                        explicitly &mdash; an expired lease is the only failure signal.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Jobs reassigned more than the failure threshold are <strong>failed</strong>: they are
                        excluded from assignment and evicted from the schedule only when the queue exceeds
                        its size limit.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Worker attribution is observed by the raft leader when it assigns jobs and processes
                        status updates; it is not replicated. After a leader change, the worker of a job is
                        unknown until the worker renews the lease. Timestamps derived from lease deadlines
                        refer to the leader clock.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        The planner queues at the bottom list blocks that await compaction and have not been
                        turned into jobs yet.
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </details>
        </div>

        <div class="row gy-4">
            <h2>Scheduler</h2>
            <div class="col-12">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div class="card-detail-row">
                            <div class="card-detail-label">Jobs:</div>
                            <div class="card-detail-value">{{ .TotalJobs }} (queue size limit {{ .MaxQueueSize }})</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-detail-row">
                            <div class="card-detail-label">Status:</div>
                            <div class="card-detail-value">
                                <span class="badge text-bg-secondary">unassigned</span> {{ .Unassigned }}
                                <span class="badge text-bg-success ms-2">in progress</span> {{ .InProgress }}
                                <span class="badge text-bg-warning ms-2">lease expired</span> {{ .LeaseExpired }}
                                <span class="badge text-bg-danger ms-2">failed</span> {{ .Failed }}
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-detail-row">
                            <div class="card-detail-label">Job lease duration:</div>
                            <div class="card-detail-value">{{ .LeaseDuration }}</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-detail-row">
                            <div class="card-detail-label">Job failure threshold:</div>
                            <div class="card-detail-value">{{ .MaxFailures }}</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-detail-row">
                            <div class="card-detail-label">Blocks awaiting compaction:</div>
                            <div class="card-detail-value">{{ .QueuedBlocks }}</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row gy-4">
            <h2>
                Jobs by Level
                <span
                        class="text-info ms-2"
                        data-bs-toggle="tooltip"
                        data-bs-placement="right"
                        title="Jobs of lower compaction levels are prioritized: no job is assigned at a level until all eligible jobs of lower levels are assigned.">
                    <i class="bi bi-info-circle"></i>
                </span>
            </h2>
            <div class="table-responsive">
                <table class="table table-bordered table-hover table-striped">
                    <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Level</th>
                        <th>Jobs</th>
                        <th>Unassigned</th>
                        <th>In Progress</th>
                        <th>Lease Expired</th>
                        <th>Failed</th>
                        <th>Oldest Job</th>
                    </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                    {{ range .Levels }}
                        <tr>
                            <td class="align-middle">{{ .Level }}</td>
                            <td class="align-middle">{{ .Total }}</td>
                            <td class="align-middle">{{ .Unassigned }}</td>
                            <td class="align-middle">{{ .InProgress }}</td>
                            <td class="align-middle">{{ .LeaseExpired }}</td>
                            <td class="align-middle">{{ .Failed }}</td>
                            <td class="align-middle">{{ .OldestJobAge }}</td>
                        </tr>
                    {{ else }}
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="7" class="text-body-secondary">The schedule is empty: no compaction jobs.</td>
                        </tr>
                    {{ end }}
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row gy-4">
            <h2>
                Workers
                <span
                        class="text-info ms-2"
                        data-bs-toggle="tooltip"
                        data-bs-placement="right"
                        title="Workers that own compaction jobs, as observed by the raft leader. After a leader change, a worker appears here again once it renews a job lease.">
                    <i class="bi bi-info-circle"></i>
                </span>
            </h2>
            <div class="table-responsive">
                <table class="table table-bordered table-hover table-striped">
                    <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Worker</th>
                        <th>Jobs</th>
                        <th>Expired Leases</th>
                        <th>Failed Jobs</th>
                        <th>Last Update</th>
                    </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                    {{ range .Workers }}
                        <tr>
                            <td class="align-middle font-monospace small">{{ .Worker }}</td>
                            <td class="align-middle">{{ .Jobs }}</td>
                            <td class="align-middle">{{ .LeaseExpired }}</td>
                            <td class="align-middle">{{ .Failed }}</td>
                            <td class="align-middle">{{ .LastUpdate }}</td>
                        </tr>
                    {{ else }}
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="5" class="text-body-secondary">No job assignments have been observed.</td>
                        </tr>
                    {{ end }}
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row gy-4">
            <h2>
                Jobs
                <span
                        class="text-info ms-2"
                        data-bs-toggle="tooltip"
                        data-bs-placement="right"
                        title="Jobs are listed in the scheduling order within each level. Reassignments counts expired leases: the job is excluded from assignment when it reaches the failure threshold. The token is the fencing token of the current assignment (the raft log index at assignment time).">
                    <i class="bi bi-info-circle"></i>
                </span>
            </h2>
            {{ if .TruncatedJobs }}
                <div class="col-12">
                    <div class="alert alert-warning" role="alert">
                        Showing the first {{ len .Jobs }} jobs in the scheduling order; {{ .TruncatedJobs }} more
                        jobs are not displayed. The summary sections above cover the entire schedule.
                    </div>
                </div>
            {{ end }}
            <div class="table-responsive">
                <table class="table table-bordered table-hover table-striped">
                    <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Name</th>
                        <th>Tenant</th>
                        <th>Shard</th>
                        <th>Level</th>
                        <th>Status</th>
                        <th>Worker</th>
                        <th>Reassignments</th>
                        <th>Blocks</th>
                        <th>Age</th>
                        <th>Assigned</th>
                        <th>Lease</th>
                        <th>Token</th>
                    </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                    {{ range .Jobs }}
                        <tr>
                            <td class="align-middle font-monospace small">{{ .Name }}</td>
                            <td class="align-middle font-monospace small">{{ .Tenant }}</td>
                            <td class="align-middle">{{ .Shard }}</td>
                            <td class="align-middle">{{ .Level }}</td>
                            <td class="align-middle"><span class="badge text-bg-{{ .StatusBadge }}">{{ .Status }}</span></td>
                            <td class="align-middle font-monospace small">{{ .Worker }}</td>
                            <td class="align-middle">{{ .Reassignments }}</td>
                            <td class="align-middle">{{ .SourceBlocks }}</td>
                            <td class="align-middle">{{ .Age }}</td>
                            <td class="align-middle">{{ .Assigned }}</td>
                            <td class="align-middle">{{ .Lease }}</td>
                            <td class="align-middle font-monospace small">{{ .Token }}</td>
                        </tr>
                    {{ else }}
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="12" class="text-body-secondary">The schedule is empty: no compaction jobs.</td>
                        </tr>
                    {{ end }}
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row gy-4">
            <h2>
                Planner Queues
                <span
                        class="text-info ms-2"
                        data-bs-toggle="tooltip"
                        data-bs-placement="right"
                        title="Blocks awaiting compaction, queued per tenant, shard, and level. New jobs are created from these queues on demand, when workers report spare capacity.">
                    <i class="bi bi-info-circle"></i>
                </span>
            </h2>
            {{ if .TruncatedQueues }}
                <div class="col-12">
                    <div class="alert alert-warning" role="alert">
                        Showing the first {{ len .Queues }} queues ordered by level, tenant, and shard;
                        {{ .TruncatedQueues }} more queues are not displayed. The blocks awaiting compaction
                        counter above covers all queues.
                    </div>
                </div>
            {{ end }}
            <div class="table-responsive">
                <table class="table table-bordered table-hover table-striped">
                    <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Tenant</th>
                        <th>Shard</th>
                        <th>Level</th>
                        <th>Blocks</th>
                        <th>Oldest Block</th>
                        <th>Newest Block</th>
                    </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                    {{ range .Queues }}
                        <tr>
                            <td class="align-middle font-monospace small">{{ .Tenant }}</td>
                            <td class="align-middle">{{ .Shard }}</td>
                            <td class="align-middle">{{ .Level }}</td>
                            <td class="align-middle">{{ .Blocks }}</td>
                            <td class="align-middle">{{ .OldestBlock }}</td>
                            <td class="align-middle">{{ .NewestBlock }}</td>
                        </tr>
                    {{ else }}
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="6" class="text-body-secondary">No blocks are awaiting compaction.</td>
                        </tr>
                    {{ end }}
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</main>
<footer class="footer mt-auto py-3">
    <div class="container">
        <small class="text-muted">Status @ {{ .Now.Format "2006-01-02 15:04:05.000" }}</small>
    </div>
</footer>
<script type="text/javascript">
    const tooltipTriggerList = document.querySelectorAll('[data-bs-toggle="tooltip"]')
    const tooltipList = [...tooltipTriggerList].map(tooltipTriggerEl => new bootstrap.Tooltip(tooltipTriggerEl))
</script>
</body>
</html>
